# Sumo Logic

> Sumo Logic is a cloud-native SaaS platform for modern SIEM, security analytics, log analytics, and observability. Founded in 2010 and headquartered in Redwood City, CA. Serves 2,400+ customers globally, analyzing 3.5+ exabytes of data daily. Trusted by mid-market to enterprise security and engineering teams managing complex, multi-cloud environments.

