## Competitive Comparisons

- [Sumo Logic vs. Splunk ES](https://www.sumologic.com/vs/splunk-enterprise-security): Cloud-native SaaS vs. on-prem/single-tenant. Faster time to value, streaming detection, predictable Flex Licensing, SOAR at every tier.
- [Sumo Logic vs. Microsoft Sentinel](https://www.sumologic.com/vs/microsoft-sentinel): Platform-agnostic schemaless ingest vs. Azure-optimized. AI included at no consumption surcharge.
- [Sumo Logic vs. Datadog](https://www.sumologic.com/vs/datadog): Investigation-first with built-in SIEM vs. metrics-centric monitoring. Single retention tier.
- [Sumo Logic vs. Google SecOps](https://www.sumologic.com/vs/google-security-operations): Cloud-agnostic with mature triage vs. Google lock-in; Google's AI triage agents still in preview as of mid-2026.
- [Sumo Logic vs. Elastic](https://www.sumologic.com/vs/elastic): Multi-tenant SaaS with embedded AI vs. operational overhead for most Elastic deployments.
- [Sumo Logic vs. Coralogix](https://www.sumologic.com/vs/coralogix): Schemaless ingest and established SIEM vs. newer pipeline-dependent architecture.
- [Sumo Logic vs. IBM QRadar](https://www.sumologic.com/vs/qradar): Cloud-native vs. legacy SIEM in sustain mode. QRadar SaaS sold to Palo Alto; cloud customers required to migrate by April 2026.
- [Competitive Overview](https://www.sumologic.com/vs): Overview of all competitive comparisons

